[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_rjvph")
name = "Blindness"
icon = ExtResource("1_biwb8")
short_info = "NULL OR GENERIC ALT-TEXT"
manual_text = "[b][u]CLINICAL OVERVIEW[/u][/b]
Blindness is a condition involving partial or complete loss of vision. According to recent global estimates, it affects approximately 43.2 million people worldwide.

[b][u]FORMS & CAUSES[/u][/b]
[indent]
[b]•[/b] [u]Total Blindness:[/u] A complete lack of light perception. Users rely exclusively on assistive technologies like screen readers or Braille displays.
[b]•[/b] [u]Light Perception:[/u] The ability to perceive light and shadows without distinguishing shapes.
[b]•[/b] The \"disability\" in software occurs when the UI lacks the semantic structure necessary for screen readers to translate visual layouts into navigable information.
[/indent]"
related_wcag = ExtResource("1_yt0pc")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://dry85ilgnq64e"
